@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #333333
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
hide empty description

title booking.status
[*] --> PENDING : customer books, rooms held
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : SePay transfer matches code and amount
PENDING --> EXPIRED : not paid within 15 minutes
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : customer cancels with no refund, or the refund is approved
CONFIRMED --> CHECKED_IN : staff checks the guest in (paid, no refund waiting)
CONFIRMED --> NO_SHOW : staff marks no-show, or the system at the check-out time
CHECKED_IN --> COMPLETED : staff checks the guest out (early or late)
EXPIRED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
NO_SHOW --> [*]
legend bottom
A cancellation with a refund keeps the booking CONFIRMED until the partner decides (see invoice.payment_status).
There is no automatic check-out: an overdue guest stays CHECKED_IN.
endlegend
@enduml